WEBVTT

00:09:59.374 --> 00:10:00.860
while nothing is happening

00:10:00.884 --> 00:10:03.151
and everything is happening,
at the same time.

00:10:03.569 --> 00:10:06.075
So when I began to think about eroticism,

00:10:06.099 --> 00:10:08.670
I began to think about the poetics of sex.

00:10:09.448 --> 00:10:11.756
And if I look at it as an intelligence,

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:13.953
then it's something that you cultivate.

00:10:13.977 --> 00:10:15.525
What are the ingredients?

00:10:15.549 --> 00:10:18.196
Imagination, playfulness,

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:21.332
novelty, curiosity, mystery.

00:10:21.784 --> 00:10:26.543
But the central agent is really
that piece called the imagination.

00:10:26.567 --> 00:10:29.702
But more importantly,
for me to begin to understand

00:10:29.726 --> 00:10:32.298
who are the couples
who have an erotic spark,